{"id":"bf32127d4122f9c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Collapse Isomorphism","display":"df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism — ZFC Collapse Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism — ZFC Collapse Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-bijective]]","[[58-df-transitive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism — ZFC Collapse Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"58-df-transitive\">58-df-transitive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in V\">\\(M,N\\in V\\)</span> (carriers with the inherited membership relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\subseteq M\\times N\">\\(\\pi\\subseteq M\\times N\\)</span> (map candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\)</span> (bijection and transitivity predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CollapseIsomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CollapseIsomorphism}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{CollapseIsomorphism}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,M,N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{CollapseIsomorphism}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,M,N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the explicit membership-structure isomorphism used by the Mostowski collapse.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\subseteq M\\times N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Transitive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CollapseIsomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{CollapseIsomorphism}_S(\\pi,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,M,N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in M\\;(x\\in y\\leftrightarrow\\pi(x)\\in\\pi(y))","display":true}],"bytes":987,"backlinks":[{"id":"667f12356049b299","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CollapseIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (membership-preserving isomorphism, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1631","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism.md|58-df-zfc-collapse-isomorphism]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d583890235faf0d5","2d9fd66bae7ead5a"]}